# Root Docker build-context ignore.
#
# Images built with the REPO ROOT as context (docker-compose sets
# `context: ..`) because their go.mod/package.json needs sibling workspace
# packages that live outside their own service directory:
#   - agents        — packages/excalidraw-dsl, packages/design-projection
#   - orchestrator  — packages/contracts/orchestration (relative `replace`)
#   - aep-api       — packages/contracts/orchestration (relative `replace`)
# Every other image (console, the local stub services) builds from a
# narrower per-service context and never sees this file, so entries here
# only need to keep those three root builds sane.
#
# Mirrors .gitignore's build-artifact set — none of this is needed inside the
# image; the Dockerfile builds workspace deps from source. EXCEPTION:
# aep-api's OpenChoreo client (internal/clients/openchoreo/gen/*.gen.go) is
# gitignored (regenerated via `make gen` — oapi-codegen against a fetched
# upstream spec) but NOT regenerated as a Docker build step, so it must ride
# along as already-generated local output — un-ignored below, same as it
# always was when aep-api built from its own narrower per-service context
# (services/aep-api/.dockerignore has no *.gen.go exclusion).
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo
generated
**/generated
*.gen.go
*.gen.ts
!services/aep-api/internal/clients/openchoreo/gen/*.gen.go

# VCS / editor / OS cruft.
.git
.gitignore
.DS_Store
*.log

# Secrets — never bake these into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dev-only scratch (services/agents playground threads; not part of the image).
chat_playground
**/chat_playground
